<title>USA: NYSE closing averages.</title>
<headline>NYSE closing averages.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK</dateline>
<text>
<p>Prices on the New York Stock Exchange closed mixed in heavy trading Thursday.</p>
<p>The Dow Jones Industrial Average rose 14.16 to 6437.10.</p>
<p>The NYSE Composite fell 0.48 to 392.75.</p>
<p>The average price per share fell $0.05.</p>
<p>Losers beat winners 1273 to 1223.</p>
<p>Volume was 483,121,760, compared with 493,701,070 Wednesday.</p>
